{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_metrics_prom_client_adapter_promclientregistry", "label": "promClientRegistry", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/metrics/prom-client-adapter.mdx", "source_location": "prom-client-Adapter", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Schreibt direkt durch zu prom-client - kein Hintergrund-Sync, kein Intervall, keine zweite Kopie der Werte. prom-client haelt den kanonischen Zustand, damit ein einziger /metrics-Endpunkt Framework- und App-Metriken zusammen ausliefert."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_metrics_prom_client_adapter_promclientadapteroptions", "label": "PromClientAdapterOptions", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/metrics/prom-client-adapter.mdx", "source_location": "Konfiguration", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "client und registry sind Pflicht - ohne sie hat die Bruecke nichts, wohin sie publizieren kann. namePrefix macht die von der Bruecke stammenden Familien in der Exposition erkennbar."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_metrics_prom_client_adapter_bridge_cardinality_cap", "label": "Kardinalitaetsgrenze der prom-client-Bruecke", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/metrics/prom-client-adapter.mdx", "source_location": "Kardinalitaetsgrenze", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Dieselbe Grenze pro Familie wie die In-Process-Registry, aber dringender gebraucht: prom-client legt bei jedem .labels(...) eine Serie an und laesst sie nie verfallen, ein unbeschraenktes Label laesst also den Resident-Speicher wachsen, nicht nur den Scrape-Body. Jenseits der Grenze wird das Tupel auf die DEKLARIERTEN Label-Namen umgeschrieben (Werte auf __overflow__), weil prom-client die Label-Namen bei der Konstruktion festlegt und bei einem .labels(...) mit anderen Namen wirft - ein synthetischer Marker-Name wuerde genau den Aufruf sprengen, der den Schaden begrenzen soll."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_metrics_prom_client_adapter_promclientregistry", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_metrics_prom_client_adapter_promclientadapteroptions", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/metrics/prom-client-adapter.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_metrics_prom_client_adapter_promclientregistry", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_metrics_core_metrics_metricsextension", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/metrics/prom-client-adapter.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_metrics_prom_client_adapter_promclientregistry", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_metrics_prometheus_exporter_exportprometheus", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/metrics/prom-client-adapter.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_metrics_prom_client_adapter_bridge_cardinality_cap", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_metrics_prom_client_adapter_promclientregistry", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/metrics/prom-client-adapter.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_metrics_prom_client_adapter_bridge_cardinality_cap", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_metrics_